{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Predecessor</i>\u00a0is an atmospheric, surreal walking simulator. Traverse a series of abstract, ephemeral worlds. Interact with various strange characters and objects. Collect artifacts and memories scattered across the worlds. Follow the path of the one who came before you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game engages in themes including the postmodern pastiche, artistic intent, and the presence of virtual spaces.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abstract and surreal environments to explore!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esoteric and silly characters who talk about things!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items which shed light on the world and its formation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strong emphasis on narrative and atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fairly short experience (1-2 hours).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worlds that will not last.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4077160?t=1762220371","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4077160?t=1762220371","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077160/897c5a1d0911789827d5f243c24bcff0993bbb03/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762220371","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077160/897c5a1d0911789827d5f243c24bcff0993bbb03/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762220371","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Contains references to violence."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Predecessor</i>\u00a0is an atmospheric, surreal walking simulator. Traverse a series of abstract, ephemeral worlds. Interact with various strange characters and objects. Collect artifacts and memories scattered across the worlds. Follow the path of the one who came before you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game engages in themes including the postmodern pastiche, artistic intent, and the presence of virtual spaces.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abstract and surreal environments to explore!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esoteric and silly characters who talk about things!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items which shed light on the world and its formation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strong emphasis on narrative and atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fairly short experience (1-2 hours).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worlds that will not last.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Thomas Ward"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077160/94b27e150c665f310585f86fd67c234b470c92e8/header.jpg?t=1762220371","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 High Sierra<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4077160/355333666/15f38f6ae527eab6d508ea38f7f7645e2d259db6/1761102027/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761102912","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4077160/355333666/15f38f6ae527eab6d508ea38f7f7645e2d259db6/1761102027/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761102912","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/407716